Written by hand for this repository on 2026-11-19 (CC0 1.0: no rights
reserved; unit st-open-foreign-i), in the LTspice schematic and symbol text
formats as KiCad's LTspice importer reads them
(eeschema/sch_io/ltspice/ltspice_schematic.cpp: SHEET, WIRE, FLAG, SYMBOL,
SYMATTR and TEXT in the .asc; LINE, CIRCLE, WINDOW, SYMATTR, PIN and PINATTR
in the .asy):
- divider.asc: a 5 V source V1 and two 10k resistors R1 and R2 in series, the
  divider's middle labeled "out", the bottom on ground ("0"), and the
  directive .op.
- res.asy and voltage.asy: the two symbols it places, drawn here (no file of
  LTspice's own is copied). KiCad's importer looks for a symbol's .asy beside
  the .asc first, so the import finds them without an LTspice install.

files.json lists the files staged together. Read by
tests/e2e/st/st-open-foreign-i.spec.ts. The files carry no comment, so this
file holds their license.
